==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{term|vit||wits, intellect|lang=is}} + {{term|-laus||[[-less]], free of something, without|lang=is}}.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|vitlausari|vitlausastur}}

# [[stupid]], [[foolish]]
#: ''Mikið eru [[dúfa|dúfur]] '''vitlaus''' dýr.''
